[00:01.00] 作曲 : Zach Bryan
[00:02.00] 制作人 : Zach Bryan
[00:20.91] I've been out and I've been drinking
[00:20.91] 我四处游荡 纵情饮酒
[00:23.53] Why am I always thinking about things
[00:23.53] 为何思绪总围绕着
[00:26.34] That don't really matter like twin towers and satellites?
[00:26.34] 那些无关紧要的事 比如双子塔与卫星
[00:31.07] Everyone I know got older
[00:31.07] 我认识的人都在老去
[00:33.60] Told my drunk ass to get sober
[00:33.60] 劝我醉醺醺的脑袋清醒过来
[00:36.01] Settle down and have some kids
[00:36.01] 安定下来 生儿育女
[00:38.38] Be content with all of it
[00:38.38] 满足于这所有安排
[00:40.66]
[00:41.18] What if I don't want children to grow up like their father?
[00:41.18] 倘若我不愿孩子重蹈父亲的覆辙
[00:45.51] Willing to stir shit up and start a fight, give themself up an appetite
[00:45.51] 总是惹是生非 挑起争端 点燃自己莫名的渴望
[00:50.86]
[00:54.12] Why am I in Northwest Arkansas?
[00:54.12] 我为何身处阿肯色西北
[00:58.21] Playing shows to those who don't care at all
[00:58.21] 为那些毫不在意的人表演
[01:03.18] With my money bloody, and my belt so tight
[01:03.18] 我的钞票沾着血 皮带勒得窒息般紧
[01:07.62] I work myself up an appetite
[01:07.62] 我把自己逼出贪婪的胃口
[01:12.17]
[01:23.33] I've been out and I've been drinking, cutting up my life in sections
[01:23.33] 我四处游荡 纵情饮酒 将人生分割成碎片
[01:28.22] I say I gotta act my age, shut the **** up and get on stage
[01:28.22] 我说该举止得体 闭上嘴 然后登上舞台
[01:33.20] Together I pack my bags quickly
[01:33.20] 我匆匆打包行囊
[01:35.67] Toothbrush, combs and my dogs with me
[01:35.67] 牙刷 梳子 还有我的狗
[01:38.10] Strong enough to handle this, fame and other corny shit
[01:38.10] 强大到足以应对 名声与其他陈腐烂事
[01:42.65]
